WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
No email address yet? No problem.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.500
We'll make a free Gmail together.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:07.500
Open Google's sign-up page and enter your name.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:10.500
Create your own Gmail address — a business name works.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:13.000
Make a password and write it down somewhere safe — never on our page.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Type any Google code on Google's page only. That's step one done.
